addOrbitMeasure_lintegral (H :=\n  _root_.ratVectors E p) (continuous_mixedTerm ..).enorm.measurable).ge.trans_lt\n  (IsFiniteMeasure.lintegral_lt_top_of_bounded_to_ennreal _ ⟨_, fun x ↦ by\n  erw [lintegral_count, ← (ofInjective _ (@toAdele E ..).injective.comp_left).tsum_eq]\n  simpa [← ofReal_norm] using! D.tsum_enorm_mixedTerm_le.choose_spec (ϱ _ (D.lAdelic.mulVec x) f)⟩)⟩\n"),("src/Lib/Weil/MixedModel/NameModulus.lean","import Lib.Weil.MixedModel.Names\nimport Lib.General.Algebra.LatticeComplement\n\n/-! Part of: Schrödinger and mixed models of the Weil representation; action of parabolic subgroups\n(known result; see Lib.Weil.MixedModel.ZeroTermLaw).\n\nPart of: Theta kernels of unitary dual pairs: functoriality, seesaw, growth, rapid decay (known\nresult; see Lib.Weil.DualPair.KernelDecay).\n\nThis file: Moduli prime to their conjugate; theta kernel of a polynomial and function modulo m.\nReduction of integral adeles modulo m, lifted functions, primitive additive character modulo m. -/\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nopen NumberField Finset RingHom MeasureTheory Ideal Quotient Function Space stdLattice\n\n/-- A modulus: a nonzero ideal of O_E prime to its complex conjugate, that is, never divisible\nby both w and w̄. -/\nstructure Modulus E [Field E] [NumberField E] [IsCMField E] where\n  ideal : Ideal (𝓞 E)\n  ne_bot : ideal ≠ ⊥\n  not_le_star (w : FinPlace E) : ideal ≤ w → ¬ideal ≤ star w\n\nvariable {E : Type _} [Field E] [CMType E] [WeilData E]\n\nnamespace Modulus\n\nsection\n\nvariable {E : Type _} [Field E] [NumberField E] [IsCMField E]\n\n/-- The residue ring O_E/𝔪 of the modulus 𝔪. -/\nabbrev ResRing (𝔪 : Modulus E) := _ ⧸ 𝔪.ideal\n\ninstance (𝔪 : Modulus E) : Fintype 𝔪.ResRing :=\n  @.ofFinite _ (Ideal.finiteQuotientOfFreeOfNeBot _ 𝔪.ne_bot)\n\n/-- The set of finite places of E that divide 𝔪. -/\ndef places (𝔪 : Modulus E) := {w : FinPlace E | 𝔪.ideal ≤ w}\n\nend\n\nvariable {n n' : Type} [Fintype n] [Fintype n'] {s : n → ℤˣ} {s' : n' → ℤˣ} (S : Space E